                        <due></due>
                            <votes>1</votes>
                                    <watches>3</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16423838" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 3 Apr 2018 10:52:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Apparently, the problem is deeper than I thought in the first place. &lt;br/&gt;
1) SQL permissions have never worked correctly. If query is executed through cache API, then we only check permissions against this cache. It means, that if one has read permission to one cache, it could be used as a &quot;window&quot; for all other caches.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Our new DML and DDL commands are not integrated into security circuit anyhow at the moment. They require different checks and permissions comparing to &lt;tt&gt;SELECT&lt;/tt&gt; statements. Also note that with DDL we need to have completely new permissions for &lt;tt&gt;CREATE/DROP INDEX&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16590370" author="isapego" created="Thu, 23 Aug 2018 15:17:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, maybe, we should hide this ticket?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16594529" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 28 Aug 2018 05:14:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt;, agree. I&apos;ve made it private.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16672816" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 2 Nov 2018 09:34:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;PR: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5238&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5238&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16672819" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 2 Nov 2018 09:36:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Test run (only SQL part is affected): &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2226029&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2226029&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16673009" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 2 Nov 2018 11:53:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tests are OK.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
